freedomnas-module-containers (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Docker runtime installed and set up from the WebUI, with its data
    on ZFS datasets of a chosen pool, started after the pool by the
    reconciler
  * Containers and images from the WebUI: start, stop, restart, logs,
    remove, download, prune, and run a container (Expert)
  * Apps: Docker Compose projects on datasets of their own, brought up
    again at boot
  * Catalogue: Home Assistant, Immich, Jellyfin, Nextcloud, Pi-hole and
    Vaultwarden, installed with checked settings and generated passwords

 -- FreedomNAS Team <dev@freedomnas.io>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:17:27 +0000
